# Dragon does not require a .env file. API keys are pasted into the app's
# Settings window and stored in the Electron userData directory
# (see PROGRESS.md / README.md for the exact path).
#
# These variables are optional developer conveniences only:
# if set, the app's dev-mode settings loader will pre-fill Settings the
# first time the app runs (see src/main/settings-store.ts). They are never
# required and are never read at runtime after first launch.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
